  "answer": "A",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$$\\Delta\\theta = \\frac{1.22\\lambda}{D} = \\frac{1.22 \\times 600 \\times 10^{-9}}{2} = 3.66 \\times 10^{-7}\\ \\text{rad}$$",
